 "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scjost.jpg"}], "slug": "cave-story-plus--1", "storyline": "You wake up in a dark cave with no memory of who you are, where you came from or why you're in such a place. Uncovering Mimiga Village you discover that the once-carefree Mimigas are in danger at the hands of a maniacal scientist. The Mimigas\u2019 only hope rest squarely on the shoulders of a quiet, amnesiac boy who can't remember his own name.", "summary": "A young amnesiac hero discovers a hidden land and vows to protect the defenseless creatures who live there! Can he stop the mad doctor and learn the truth about his own past? Highly polished and addictive, Cave Story+ uses retro-game stylings to deliver an all-out action/adventure extravaganza that\u2019s both charming and deadly!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cave-story-plus--1", "videos": [{"id": 10997, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "VQpHejqlzzY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VQpHejqlzzY", "title": "Cave Story+ PC/Mac Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VQpHejqlzzY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 46503, "name": "Nintendo Switch Trailer", "video_id": "46xP8F1seWk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46xP8F1seWk", "title": "\u300eCave Story+\u300f\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u516c\u958b", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/46xP8F1seWk/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1576, "name": "Cave Story"}]}